OL,3,GNEWSABBC secret filming shows dog      
OL,4,Abreeder selling sick puppies for #2k   
OL,5,Aeach                                   
OL,7,FWhen Katie Thornton paid #2,000 for a  
OL,8,Fnine-week-old puppy for her son, she   
OL,9,Fknew it was a premium price - but was  
OL,10,Fhappy to be doing business with a      
OL,11,F"legit", council-approved breeder.     
OL,13,FBut Ozzy the Dobermann pup started     
OL,14,Fcoughing in the car on the way home,   
OL,15,Fand within 48 hours he was in a        
OL,16,Fveterinary hospital receiving urgent   
OL,17,Ftreatment for pneumonia.               
OL,19,FSince then, his ongoing health problems
OL,20,Fmean Katie has racked up more than     
OL,21,F#5,000 in vet bills.                   
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
